#: ../../source/index.rst:4 59dc38284e7345cf86cf65269800aaf7
msgid ""
"NepTrainKit 用于准备、检查和可视化 NEP 训练数据。它负责生成候选结构、检查异常样本、 筛选代表结构和回看训练结果；DFT 标注与 "
"GPUMD 训练仍在对应软件中完成。"
msgstr ""
"NepTrainKit prepares, inspects, and visualizes NEP training data. It "
"generates candidate structures, checks for anomalous samples, selects "
"representative structures, and helps review training results; DFT "
"labeling and GPUMD training are still carried out in the corresponding "
"software."

#: ../../source/index.rst:8 2bdf9934eb274476bfd1990f7bb23ca3
msgid "从哪里开始"
msgstr "Where to start"

#: ../../source/index.rst:10 3319642b108f4f11b6cf316c272ac78d
msgid "先按你现在遇到的问题选择入口。第一次使用才需要从“快速开始”按顺序阅读；已经打开软件、 只是看不懂某个页面或参数时，直接进入“功能指南”。"
msgstr ""
"Choose an entry point based on what you are trying to do. Only first-time"
" users need to read Quick Start from beginning to end; if the application"
" is already open and you need to look up a page or parameter, go straight"
" to the Feature Guide."

#: ../../source/index.rst:16 6fb19261d94045498b0afcfd4435cfeb
msgid "第一次安装和使用"
msgstr "Install and use NepTrainKit for the first time"

#: ../../source/index.rst:20 9d2bdbbfd34f4fad9175a1171208308e
msgid "从安装、启动、生成第一批候选结构，一直走到清洗前的检查。"
msgstr ""
"Go from installation and launch to generating your first candidate "
"structures and checking them before cleaning."

#: ../../source/index.rst:22 213d7568a2bf43f4acec5519561db2ad
msgid "软件里的某个功能不会用"
msgstr "I need help with a feature"

#: ../../source/index.rst:26 0f151ca84b954f2fa75c9630b03fb65f
msgid "按桌面软件页面顺序查按钮、参数、默认行为和输出。"
msgstr ""
"Look up buttons, parameters, default behavior, and outputs in the same "
"order as the desktop interface."

#: ../../source/index.rst:28 da380248446f481ebb7ce62aca32d090
msgid "我已经有候选结构"
msgstr "I already have candidate structures"

#: ../../source/index.rst:32 81371cd825dc44c782c069774185bba8
msgid "在 ``NEP 数据集查看`` 中检查异常，再做代表性采样并送去 DFT。"
msgstr ""
"Inspect them in ``NEP Dataset Display``, select representative samples, "
"and send those samples to DFT."

#: ../../source/index.rst:34 d07c007d1ec7419b93141d215f3568f1
msgid "我想复盘训练结果"
msgstr "I want to review training results"

#: ../../source/index.rst:38 a324d340e6904c54b97009e41a3bb89d
msgid "从误差和异常结构追到数据缺口，组织下一轮补数据。"
msgstr ""
"Trace errors and anomalous structures back to gaps in the dataset, then "
"plan the next round of data generation."

#: ../../source/index.rst:40 c02ddf4622e741178c7aa5ba09191a9f
msgid "软件报错或没有输出"
msgstr "The application reports an error or produces no output"

#: ../../source/index.rst:44 b81d4b68aac0495eb8d6b90329af1414
msgid "按“导入失败、卡片无输出、CUDA 不可用”等症状直接排查。"
msgstr ""
"Troubleshoot directly by symptom, such as an import failure, an empty "
"card output, or unavailable CUDA."

#: ../../source/index.rst:46 e3f03ae84ff94098b49370d8a519878f
msgid "看不懂术语或字段"
msgstr "I do not understand a term or field"

#: ../../source/index.rst:50 155b6e6d52014ae9bf08e959a58ff891
msgid "集中查询 ``Config_type``、FPS、GSFE、virial 和 ``spin:R:3``。"
msgstr "Look up ``Config_type``, FPS, GSFE, virial, and ``spin:R:3`` in one place."

#: ../../source/index.rst:53 42ac49a07a1b45b381ce793d59ca2bce
msgid "按软件页面查功能"
msgstr "Find features by application page"

#: ../../source/index.rst:55 f60434fb8a3147d0b6bf7172c96e1e00
