#: ../../source/index.rst:83 c81dc53cd9a84af69f8f9604faa6e4a3
msgid "NepTrainKit 在训练流程中的位置是："
msgstr "NepTrainKit fits into the training workflow as follows:"

#: ../../source/index.rst:85 4acb42a484374997a5256d91374f4b19
msgid ""
"构建数据集：生成候选结构\n"
"→ NEP 数据集查看：检查并清洗异常结构\n"
"→ FPS 代表性采样或其他方法选择代表结构\n"
"→ DFT 标注能量、力、应力\n"
"→ GPUMD 训练 NEP\n"
"→ NEP 数据集查看：回看误差并开始下一轮"
msgstr ""
"Make Dataset: generate candidate structures\n"
"→ NEP Dataset Display: inspect and clean anomalous structures\n"
"→ FPS Sampling or another method: select representative structures\n"
"→ DFT: label energies, forces, and stresses\n"
"→ GPUMD: train the NEP model\n"
"→ NEP Dataset Display: review errors and start the next iteration"

#: ../../source/index.rst:94 0bea7bb64ac540dba4869190bcafe2a1
msgid ""
"如果你是在完成一整段工作，而不是查询单个按钮，进入 :doc:`workflows/index`。 "
"如果你已经知道具体目标，例如能量平移、最大误差筛选或 DFT-D3 修正，进入 :doc:`example/index`。"
msgstr ""
"If you are completing an end-to-end task rather than looking up one "
"button, open :doc:`workflows/index`. If you already have a specific "
"objective, such as shifting energies, selecting the largest-error "
"structures, or applying a DFT-D3 correction, open :doc:`example/index`."

